WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.710
- [Female] This Great Big
Story was made possible by

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:06.819
Singapore Airlines, a great way to fly.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:09.700
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.040
- [Narrator] With more
than 300 million farmers,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.349
agriculture in China is a vital industry.

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:18.620
Yet one man chose to break with convention

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.190
and traded his tractor for a dream.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.333
He wanted to fly.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.810
Lacking any resources,

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.100
he built his first successful aircraft

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.196
from his family's farming equipment.

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:33.279
(man speaks in foreign language)

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.980
- [Narrator] Today, this
former farmer makes his living

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.880
building unusual aircraft

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.393
and spends his free time up in the sky.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:51.088
(light music)
(speaks in foreign language)

